00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:33.200
-But your relationship with Denzel Washington

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.033
has been very humbling, I would say, to say the least.

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:38.834
-Very, very humbling. Yes, Jimmy. That's true.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.801
Last year, I was getting cooked online,

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:43.334
