00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.567
And Denzel goes...

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:51.934
[As Denzel] "Yeah, I don't know who that is.

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:55.167
I-I don't know. W-What's the boy's name?"

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:57.267
No idea who I am.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:59.000
-He had no idea who you were at all, yeah.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.133
So that's a little -- Yeah. It crushes the ego a little bit.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:02.534
'Cause he's one of your idols, right?

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:04.267
-He is. He's greatest in the world.

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:05.601
-He really is.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.033
-And five days ago,

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:10.701
