00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:12.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.901
-This is what I'm talking about.

00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:15.934
-Yeah. -Wow. Finally.

00:01:15.934 --> 00:01:17.934
-Yeah. It was huge, man. He was walking by me.

00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:20.868
And, you know, I got the courage to talk to him.

00:01:20.868 --> 00:01:22.601
I was like, "Don't be a wimp, D. Talk to him."

00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:25.367
I'm like, "Mr. Washington, thank you."

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:26.801
"Thank you for everything."

00:01:26.801 --> 00:01:28.200
He like, "Thank you, son."

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.334
And I'm like, "It's Damson Idris."

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:33.501
He finally realized that it's me from last year,

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:35.434
and he's like, "Hey, my boy! Hey! Hey you!

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.267
Hey! You owe me money! You owe me money!"

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:39.801
-Is that's what he said? -It was amazing.

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:41.701
And I'm getting ready to have this moment.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:44.601
And then Draymond Green comes running over, sweating,

00:01:44.601 --> 00:01:47.300
'cause he just played four quarters.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.300
And he's like, "Denzel, can I get an autograph?"

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.100
So I'm slowly walking back,

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:54.334
slowly coming out of the frame, slowly out of the picture.

00:01:54.334 --> 00:01:56.567
Then a bunch of little kids run over, asking Draymond

00:01:56.567 --> 00:01:59.334
from an autograph from him, and then the moment was over.

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.067
The moment was ruined. [ Audience awws ]

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:02.868
-We actually got a photo

00:02:02.868 --> 00:02:04.234
