00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:08.033
And just look at how innocent. And look at your face.

00:02:08.033 --> 00:02:09.601
-[ Laughs ] No!

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:11.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:12.267
