00:02:12.267 --> 00:02:13.434
No!

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:14.667
-Like, "I was there! I was there!

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.467
Draymond, get out of there. I was almost..."

00:02:16.467 --> 00:02:20.133
-Damn you, Draymond! Damn you, Draymond!

00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:22.734
Go and take a shower!

00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:25.968
-Go do something. Go sleep. -Take an ice bath, please!

00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:27.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:30.000
-Your accent, by the way, is so good in the show.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.400
-Thank you. -Is it hard to do it?

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.067
-Man, you know what? I grew up loving "Def Comedy Jam."

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:38.934
I'd steal my brother and sister's tapes, sneak off.

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:40.634
-"Def Comedy Jam"? -"Def Comedy Jam," man.

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:42.167
