00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:44.501
-Everyone, man. I used to love Chris Tucker.

00:02:44.501 --> 00:02:46.033
I would run into the living room.

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:47.968
The whole family's there over at Christmas.

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:51.667
I would just run in, I'd be like "Pissed off, man!

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:55.667
"I am, 'cause I'm broke! Broke as a joke!

00:02:55.667 --> 00:02:58.701
